WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.796
The queen stomped her foot.

2
00:00:06.797 --> 00:00:12.114
She threw her hairbrush and screamed.

3
00:00:12.115 --> 00:00:14.661
"I hate Snow White!"

4
00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:21.950
The queen took a deep breath. "I need a plan."

5
00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:25.621
She paced back and forth across the room.

6
00:00:25.622 --> 00:00:30.384
Then she stopped. "I know!

7
00:00:30.385 --> 00:00:46.998
I will create a poison apple!"

8
00:00:46.999 --> 00:00:54.006
Snow White sat by her window.

9
00:00:54.007 --> 00:00:57.503
"Apples for sale!" a woman shouted.

10
00:00:57.504 --> 00:01:03.674
"Wonderful, delicious apples!"

11
00:01:03.675 --> 00:01:08.031
"That must be the queen again," Snow White thought.

12
00:01:08.032 --> 00:01:13.783
"Hello, dear!" The woman approached Snow White.

13
00:01:13.784 --> 00:01:17.298
"Do you want to buy an apple?"

14
00:01:17.299 --> 00:01:19.732
Snow White frowned.

15
00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:23.378
"No, thank you," she said.

16
00:01:23.379 --> 00:01:27.653
"Are you sure?" The woman held up an apple.

17
00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:30.363
"This one looks delicious."

18
00:01:30.364 --> 00:01:33.934
She held the apple closer to Snow White.

19
00:01:33.935 --> 00:01:36.387
Snow White's eyes went wide.

20
00:01:36.388 --> 00:01:40.000
"What a beautiful apple," she thought.

21
00:01:40.001 --> 00:01:41.831
It was bright red.

22
00:01:41.832 --> 00:01:46.518
Light seemed to sparkle around it.

23
00:01:46.519 --> 00:01:50.483
"I must not trust this woman," Snow White thought.

24
00:01:50.484 --> 00:01:54.716
But the apple looked so . . . delicious.

25
00:01:54.717 --> 00:01:59.202
The woman smiled. "Try it, dear."

26
00:01:59.203 --> 00:02:03.717
Snow White gazed at the apple.

27
00:02:03.718 --> 00:02:10.056
"Just . . . one bite," she murmured.

28
00:02:10.057 --> 00:02:15.722
Snow White's teeth sank deep into the apple.

29
00:02:15.723 --> 00:02:26.362
Everything went dark.

30
00:02:26.363 --> 00:02:29.516
"Mirror!" the queen snapped.

31
00:02:29.517 --> 00:02:34.112
"Who is the most beautiful woman in the land?"

32
00:02:34.113 --> 00:02:38.742
"My Lady." The mirror sounded sad.

33
00:02:38.743 --> 00:02:46.015
"You are."

